    {
      "id": "claim_d5c188067d34462285c294d38a7ee2b6",
      "statement": "MAX_UPLOAD_MB (default 200) and MAX_EXTRACTED_MB (default 1024) are separate upload-path limits but are not equally guarded: only MAX_UPLOAD_MB appears in the `_check_positive` validator, so a non-positive MAX_EXTRACTED_MB is not rejected at startup.",
