      "id": "claim_96b6a3ef3f5847e5b2e76d283110d7ba",
      "statement": "`tests/test_api_wikis.py::test_upload_zip_end_to_end` pins the whole archive path: a two-file zip returns 202 with `status: \"queued\"`, polling reaches `done` with `source_type == \"upload\"` and `filename == \"code.zip\"`, and the downloaded zip contains `.openwiki/index.md`.",
